\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O heavenly King, look down from above;
\par Assist us to sing Thy mercy and love :
\par So sweetly o'erflowing, so plenteous the store,
\par Thou still art bestowing, and giving us more,
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O God of our life, we hallow Thy name :
\par Our business and strife is Thee to proclaim,
\par Accept our thanksgiving for creating grace;
\par The living shall show forth Thy praise.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Our Father and Lord, almighty art Thou;
\par Preserved by Thy word, we worship Thee now;  
\par The bountiful donor of all we enjoy,
\par Our tongues, to Thine honour, and lives we employ.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. But O above all Thy kindness we praise,
\par From sin and from thrall which saves the lost race;
\par Thy Son Thou hast given the world to redeem,
\par And bring us to heaven whose trust is in Him.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Wherefore of Thy love we sing and rejoice,
\par With angels above we lift up our voice;
\par Thy love each believer shall gladly adore,
\par For ever and ever, when time is no more.   
\par                                                     Amen.
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

